cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the Agent-Shoppable Census, please cite it as below."
title: "Agent-Shoppable Census: agent readiness among 100 US online jewelry sellers"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible census of 100 US online sellers of engagement rings and diamond
  jewelry. The dataset distinguishes merchant-built agent infrastructure from
  platform-inherited features and publishes the domain list, summary table, raw
  HTTP evidence, run metadata, methodology, and probe code.
type: dataset
authors:
